Subject: [PATCH 1698/3799] soh: rename func_80046E20 ->
 Camera_SwingAroundCollision

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the swing update: it runs the corner check and, depending on the result, peeks the eye around the corner, pulls it in to the minimum distance or lets it settle back out.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_camera.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
